# .meta Sidecar 文件规范

## 命名规则

资源文件 `foo.png` 的 sidecar 为 `.foo.png.meta`（点前缀隐藏），放在同一目录下。

## 必填字段

`__version`, `uid`, `boundFileName`, `contentHash`, `fileSize`, `type`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`

## 可选字段

`tags`, `description`, `openWith`, `origin`, `pipeline`, `relations`, `moduleData`

## Schema 示例

```json
{
  "__version": 1,
  "uid": "gs://m1abc12-x7y8z9",
  "boundFileName": "hero-walk.png",
  "contentHash": "a1b2c3d4e5f67890",
  "fileSize": 24576,
  "type": "spritesheet",
  "tags": ["character", "walk"],
  "openWith": "sprite-slicer",
  "origin": {
    "source": "derived",
    "method": "sprite-slicer/standardize",
    "sourceFiles": ["gs://m0xyz99-a1b2c3"],
    "createdBy": "g-studio",
    "importedAt": 1716451200000
  },
  "pipeline": [
    { "step": "upload", "at": 1716451200000, "detail": "user drag-drop" }
  ],
  "relations": [
    { "rel": "derived-from", "uid": "gs://m0xyz99-a1b2c3", "path": "../raw/hero-raw.png" }
  ],
  "moduleData": {
    "sprite-slicer": { "sliceConfig": {} }
  },
  "createdAt": 1716451200000,
  "updatedAt": 1716451203000
}
```

## 字段枚举

- `origin.source`: `uploaded` | `derived` | `imported` | `external`
- `origin.method`: `sprite-slicer/upload`, `sprite-slicer/standardize`, `sprite-slicer/slice`, `map-editor/export`, `zip-import`
- `relations[].rel`: `derived-from` | `produces` | `used-by` | `variant-of`
- `relations[]` 优先用 `uid` 引用，`path` 为 fallback

## 绑定字段

- `boundFileName` — 上次同步时的主文件名，reconciliation 修复后更新
- `contentHash` — 主文件 SHA-256 前 16 hex，文件内容变更时重新计算
- `fileSize` — 主文件字节大小，内容变更时同步更新

## 无 .meta 的文件

视为 `type: "generic"`, `origin.source: "external"`，双击纯预览。
